+ device s2mpu_gsa | type: samsung,gs201-s2mpu
  .
  . Stage-2 protection unit between the GSA and AP memory
  . (s2mpu_gsa@17c60000). The boot loader leaves it enabled without access,
  . so the GSA cannot read the firmware of the AoC until the audio driver
  . programs it. Powered only while the GSA's core domain is on: an access
  . at any other time is an SError. The interrupt reports faults.
  .
  + io_mem | address: 0x17c60000 | size: 0x10000
  + irq    | number: 398

+ device aoc | type: google,aoc
  .
  . AoC ("always-on compute") DSP, which all audio hangs behind
  . (aoc@19000000): its request register and the 48 MiB memory of its
  . firmware and IPC rings (reserved memory aoc@94000000, excluded from RAM
  . by bootstrap). The memory is write-combined, as Linux' ioremap_wc: the
  . firmware is copied with memcpy, the rings are read unaligned. The
  . interrupt is the AoC's watchdog.
  .
